   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Headphones**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Glad To Know Ya**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Spanish**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Vapor, Reverb [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2004-07-18.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 59 min; rated 3/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Audience chatter is audible throughout the recording, not loud enough to ruin the music but still annoying; no taper section apparent [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Venue was a fairground in a remote part of New Hampshire, and the crowd came across as unenthusiastic [2]\n- Horns were part of Soulive's performance at this show [2]\n- Tickets for the show were free, and the reviewer also found the crowd vibe flat [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2004-07-18.flac16**: taped by diggrd; transferred by diggrd; source: EW SR-77(ps2) > AD-20 > JB3 [1]",
